        "created_at": "2019-01-24T19:21:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, it absolutely will! There is a whole chapter on Character Creation!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Is Ability creation easier then Mutants and Masterminds? I have a set idea for my character just worried about ability design some pregens look like their abilities are unique some look generic.</p>",
