        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-24T19:25:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@Anubis</p>\n<p>The ability creation is much easier than Mutants and Masterminds. There are a ton of different pre-made options that you can mix and match and tweak to make more flavorful for your character. For a good example of this, watch the Character Creation episode of the livestream RPG that I ran, and see what Chris Burton does with his character. (That section will make more sense once you have the core rulebook in front of you).</p>",
